<title>AUSTRALIA: Rate risk in Australia budget attack - minister.</title>
<headline>Rate risk in Australia budget attack - minister.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian assistant Treasurer Jim Short said on Wednesday the loss of budget measures to parliamentary attack would put pressure on interest rates.</p>
<p>&quot;Let there be no mistake at all about this, that any diminution of the government's fiscal consolidation strategy risks putting more pressure on interest rates,&quot; Short told the Senate.</p>
</text>
